# Needs a rewrite: `a AND b` plus `a AND NOT b` is just `a`.
SUBJECT analyst, intern
RESOURCE dashboards SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE datasets SUPPORTS READ

ALLOW analyst READ dashboards WHEN authenticated AND on_vpn
ALLOW analyst READ dashboards WHEN authenticated AND NOT on_vpn
ALLOW intern READ datasets WHEN supervised AND training_done
ALLOW intern READ datasets WHEN supervised AND NOT training_done
ALLOW analyst WRITE dashboards WHEN owner
